\f1 \
Community patch for Star Trek: Infinite designed to merge,\
fix, and ensure compatibility between multiple Workshop mods\
within a single clean and stable package.\
\
Goal: keep the game alive, fix remaining issues, improve\
mod compatibility, and provide a solid foundation for\
future gameplay improvements.\
\

