AI improvements:\
The AI has been significantly improved. It now starts with a\
shipyard in its home system (which, surprisingly, was not\
the case before). This explains why it previously felt\
passive during gameplay.\
\
Minor AI factions:\
Newly added minor factions can now declare war and access\
advanced political options. This limitation has been fixed.\
\
Gorn Hegemony:\
The Gorn now have a fixed starting position.\
\
Federation systems:\
The Athan system has been added to the Federation.\
Maybe it's time to spend a quiet Sunday afternoon there? ;-)\
\
Denorios system:\
The Denorios system has appeared. Strange reports are coming\
in from visitors\'85 perhaps an investigation is in order?\
\
Short-term plans:\
- Study ship decommissioning mechanics \
- Improve Orion and Tholian\
- Add a new faction\
- Continue hunting down bugs (as always)!\
\
